        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Library committee starts
today. Now, where's the
library...？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Girl A</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So I stopped by the library
and said hi to her, and she
totally ignored me！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(...The library？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Girl B</Dialog>
          <Dialog>She's so annoying！ She's
been like that since the
entrance ceremony. If she
hates school so much, she
shouldn't come, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, got a second？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Where's the library again？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>The library's in the second
building, by the...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Huh, it's a pretty nice
library...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I heard there's another
committee member, a first
year... Where are they？)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？？？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, sorry！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Whoa, she's cute... My new
life here is off to a good
start！ No, wait...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Sorry, let me help you pick
them up.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...No need.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey, I'm on the library
committee. You're returning
those, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...What for？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Why？ Well...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm the library committee
member, though.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？ Then you're the first
year？ Haha, so that's it！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Is something funny about me
being a first year？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, not really...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Um, I'm
▲苗字▲ ▲名前▲,
a second year. I just
transferred in, and I'm on
the committee as of today.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Rinko Kobayakawa. The
hilarious first year.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>O-Okay... Kobayakawa-san,
then. Nice to meet you！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>If you want to quit the
committee, I'll tell the
teacher.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Me？ Why would I quit？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Tch.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>W-What is it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(My new life here is off to
a good start... right？)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
